# 4jawaly Integration Rules (Windsurf)

Same as `cursor/.cursorrules`. Copy that file's content here or symlink.

## TL;DR

- Auth: `Basic base64(KEY:SECRET)` from env (`JAWALY_API_KEY`, `JAWALY_API_SECRET`).
- SMS base: `https://api-sms.4jawaly.com/api/v1` → `/account/area/sms/send`, `/me/balances`, `/me/senders?status=1`.
- WhatsApp: `POST https://api-users.4jawaly.com/api/v1/whatsapp/{PROJECT_ID}` with `{path, params}`. `PROJECT_ID` is per-account; read from env.
  - `message/text|file|location|link|contact|template` for direct sends.
  - `global` wraps Meta Graph API for buttons/list interactive.
- Phones international, no `+`. Media HTTPS only. Interactive needs 24h window; templates don't.
